# Runtime state

orbit.db
orbit.db-shm
orbit.db-wal

# Orbit runtime state stays workspace-local. Project-authored decisions live in
# feature `docs/design/**/4_decisions.md` files.
.orbit/*
# Project learnings travel with the repo (ADR-003 in docs/design/project-learnings/4_decisions.md).
!.orbit/learnings/
# Auto-task definitions are git-versioned records (ORB-10149); the host-local
# last-fired cursor lives in `.orbit/state/` and stays ignored.
!.orbit/auto_tasks/
!.orbit/resources/
!.orbit/routines/
!.orbit/config.toml
# Lock files inside the re-included partitions stay ignored (ORB-10303); they
# are host-local, not decision history.
.orbit/**/*.lock
.monodev/

